{"title":"꽃은 꽃으로, 잎은 잎으로","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=0O5ck/hALR5Mgo8k/7L1p4Kev5BwzcEkYZ4LA8K&filename=th3","synopsis":"재벌가 첩의 딸로 태어난 홍설영은 갖은 핍박에도 굴하지 않고 떳떳하게 자리를 잡아가고 있던 중, 부모님이 갑자기 교통사고로 돌아가시게 되고 설영 또한 자살을 가장한 죽음을 맞이하게 된다.\n\n설영은 눈을 감는 순간까지 홍씨 일가를 저주하는데.... 그러다 갑작스레 의식이 돌아온 설영, 눈을 떠보니 시대극 드라마 세트장을 연상케 하는 배경이 눈에 들어온다...?\n\n그리고 머리는 언제 이렇게 길어진 거야?! 설상가상으로 자신을 '아씨'라고 부르는 소녀까지....?\n\n다른 차원에서 '홍설영'이 아닌 '장설영'으로 눈을 뜬 설영의 속시원한 복수극이 시작된다!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":243,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":186,"change":{"type":"up","amount":57}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":246,"change":{"type":"down","amount":60}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":274,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":253,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":278,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":202,"change":{"type":"up","amount":76}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":201,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":223,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":242,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":234,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":292,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":296,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":281,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":229,"change":{"type":"up","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":231,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-